sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Ingress / Service Mesh<br/>(managed by operator)
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Endpoint<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant VectorDB as Vector DB<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Qdrant)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 / Object Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Inference Request
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/inference/chat-completion<br/>Auth: OAuth2 JWT (conditional)
    Ingress->>OGX: Forward request<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
    OGX->>vLLM: Forward to inference backend<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer Token
    vLLM-->>OGX: Inference response
    OGX->>PG: Persist conversation state<br/>PostgreSQL 5432/TCP, Username/Password
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Ingress: JSON response
    Ingress-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Agentic RAG Workflow
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/responses<br/>Auth: OAuth2 JWT (conditional)
    Ingress->>OGX: Forward request<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
    OGX->>OGX: File Search (inline/in-process)
    OGX->>VectorDB: Vector similarity search<br/>HTTP/gRPC/PostgreSQL, Token/Password
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Relevant documents
    OGX->>vLLM: LLM inference with context<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer Token
    vLLM-->>OGX: Generated response
    OGX->>PG: Persist agent state<br/>PostgreSQL 5432/TCP
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Ingress: Streaming/JSON response
    Ingress-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: Secret Resolution at Startup
    Note right of OGX: entrypoint.sh reads mounted<br/>secret files (_FILE variants)<br/>for all 18 secret env vars
    OGX->>OGX: Read /mounted/secret files<br/>Resolve _FILE variants → env vars
    OGX->>OGX: Export env vars<br/>Activate providers based on env presence
    OGX->>OGX: exec ogx-server process
